# Level tiles (16x16 background metatiles; goal.box is 32x32). Original 16-bit style art (see docs/06-16bit-upgrade.md).
# Generated-then-curated; slot 0 / '.' = transparent (the level's sky gradient / parallax shows through).
#
# Notes for the engine:
# * Palettes are looked up as THEME.GROUP with fallback to default.GROUP (decor palettes live in decor.art).
#   Image -> group: ground.* -> ground, brick/coinblock -> brick, qblock.* -> qblock, note.* -> note,
#   muncher.* -> muncher, cannon.* -> cannon, door.* -> door, vine* -> vine, pipe.*/hpipe.* -> pipe,
#   semi.* -> semi, cloud.* -> cloud, block.* -> block1..block4, water* -> water, lava* -> lava,
#   conveyor.* -> conveyor, used/hard/wood/spike -> same name.
#   Not in the README group list: ice -> palette default.ice, goal.box/goal.floor -> default.goal.
# * Intended ground set per theme (one THEME.ground palette serves all sets and the slopes):
#   plains/jungle = grass, desert/sea = sand, ice = snow, sky = cloud, underground/volcano = rock,
#   fortress/castle = stone, machine = metal, airship/bonus = wood.
#   All sets share the slot meaning 1 = outline, 2-5 = surface ramp, 6-9 = body ramp, a/b = accents,
#   so any set looks right with any theme's ground palette (cloud/metal/wood themes draw grass slopes).
# * itl/itr (grass, sand, snow, cloud): TOP-SURFACE tiles at the foot of a wall, i.e. the cell above is
#   empty and the ground continues up-left (itl: left + up-left cells solid) or up-right (itr).
# * Slopes su/sd (grass, sand, snow, rock, stone): 45 degrees, surface from bottom-left to top-right (su)
#   or top-left to bottom-right (sd). sub/sdb = the tile directly UNDER an su/sd tile (tail of the band).
# * conveyor.1/.2 are drawn moving RIGHT; the engine mirrors them for a left-moving belt.
# * Animations: qblock.1-4, note.1/2 (note hops), muncher.1/2, water.top1/2, lava.top1/2, conveyor.1/2.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- palettes (16-bit, see docs/06-16bit-upgrade.md)
# ground: 1 outline, 2-5 surface deep..highlight (grass/sand crest/snow/cloud top/rock ledge/capstone/brass rail/deck),
#         6-9 body light..deep (soil/sandstone/frozen earth/cloud/rock/stone/steel/planks), a/b accent light/dark.
pal default.ground         #1C2410 #187818 #38B838 #80E048 #C8F878 #E0A860 #C88848 #985828 #603818 #E8D0A8 #A88868 #B07038
# brick: 1 mortar dark, 2 mortar, 3 shade, 4 base, 5 light, 6 highlight
pal default.brick          #301008 #683018 #A04818 #C86828 #E89048 #F8C888
# qblock: 1 outline, 2 deep, 3 shade, 4 base, 5 light, 6 highlight, 7 mark, 8 mark shadow
pal default.qblock         #402008 #A05808 #D08810 #F0B020 #F8D050 #FFF0A0 #FFFCF0 #804010
# used/hard/wood/ice/spike: 1 outline, 2 deep, 3 shade, 4 base, 5 light, 6 highlight
